---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | coaching">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">
         <!-- Section A: Hero Section --> <section class="py-20 lg:py-32 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-50"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center"> <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 leading-tight"> 專為高薪專業人士打造的<br class="hidden sm:block"/>「自動化財富系統」 </h1> <p class="text-xl text-slate-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"> 終結現金流焦慮，從防漏到跨資產佈局（含實體另類資產），重新奪回你的財務掌控權。 </p> <a href="#calendly-section" class="inline-block bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 hover:bg-emerald-700 transition duration-300 ease-in-out transform hover:-translate-y-1"> 預約免費 15 分鐘財務健檢 </a> </div> </section> <!-- Section B: Lead Capture --> <section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white text-slate-800 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200"> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">還沒準備好通話？先領取專屬內部指南</h2> <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed"> 下載《高薪族群的 3 大現金流破口與另類資產配置清單》PDF。了解多數人如何無意識地流失財富，以及富人如何利用威士忌等稀缺資產抗通膨。 </p> <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xvzvlvwa" method="POST" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto"> <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="您的姓名" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-md text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 focus:border-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1" required> <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required> <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto"> 立即免費獲取 </button> </form> </div> </section> <!-- Section C: The Framework --> <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"> <div class="text-center mb-16"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900">為什麼你需要這套教練計畫？</h2> <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-emerald-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded"></div> </div> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10"> <!-- Phase 1 Card --> <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border-none  hover:shadow-md transition duration-300"> <div class="text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xl mb-2">Phase 1</div> <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">現金流防漏與系統化</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 痛點 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">工時極長、收入高但存款不成比例、缺乏紀律。</p> </div> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 解方 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">盤點債務與隱藏支出，為你建構「發薪日自動分配系統」。讓你在不知不覺中蓄水，創造無痛的投資本金。</p> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Phase 2 Card --> <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border-none  hover:shadow-md transition duration-300"> <div class="text-emerald-700 font-bold text-xl mb-2">Phase 2</div> <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">跨資產防禦與高階認知建立</h3> <div class="space-y-4"> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 痛點 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">害怕通膨侵蝕購買力，對單一股市感到焦慮，不懂多元配置。</p> </div> <div> <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center"> <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> 解方 </h4> <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1 pl-7">跳脫傳統股房迷思。教導您佈局穩健的市場大盤，並引入「稀缺實體資產（如威士忌、名錶）」的底層投資邏輯，建立真正抗通膨的護城河。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- Section D: Final CTA & Calendly --> <section id="calendly-section" class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100"> <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">停止盲目摸索，立即啟動你的專屬財富藍圖</h2> <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10 leading-relaxed"> 點擊下方按鈕，選擇您方便的時間。在這 15 分鐘的免費通話中，我們將直接切入您的財務現況，找出最具爆發力的優化節點。 </p> <a href="https://calendly.com/" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-white text-slate-800 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200 font-semibold text-lg px-10 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-blue-800 transition duration-300"> 立即預約免費通話 </a> </div> </section> <!-- Quick Needs Submission Block --> <section class="bg-white text-slate-800 shadow-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-10 border-b border-blue-800 flex-shrink-0"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" data-i18n="footer-cta-title">對理財有疑問？留下一句話，讓我們開始對話。</h2> <form action="/contact" method="GET" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto"> <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required> <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white shadow-md font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-md" data-i18n="footer-cta-btn"> 開始諮詢 </button> </form> </div> </section> <!-- Footer inside main content --> <footer class="bg-slate-50 text-white py-6 mt-auto flex-shrink-0"> <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-sm max-w-5xl"> <div class="text-center sm:text-left mb-4 sm:mb-0"> <p>&copy; 2026 SmartUtilBox. All rights reserved.</p> <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400" data-i18n="footer-disclaimer">試算結果僅供參考，實際貸款條件以各銀行提供為準。</p> </div> <div class="space-x-4"> <a href="/privacy-policy.html" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-privacy">隱私權政策</a>
                        <a href="/terms.html" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-terms">服務條款</a> <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-gray-300 underline" data-i18n="footer-guide">理財專欄</a> </div> </div> </footer>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

